      "worked_solution": "We have $\\frac{3}{4}$ on the left and $\\frac{3}{8}$ on the right.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14130082/assets/5091a3f982e94ea27aea26a45b47bf768980dbc802f52905d0ecfc78e111f3ef.png)\n\nTherefore, the multiplication problem shown is:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{4}\\times \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{3}{8}\n$$",
